# 📦 E-Label Generator

This tool generates a regulatory e-label PNG image from a YAML description file, using Python and Pillow.  
Ideal for embedding compliance data (FCC, IC, CULUS, etc.) in Android devices (`/data/misc/elabel/regulatory_info.png`).

---

## ✨ Features

- Parse regulatory metadata from YAML
- Render text onto PNG image
- Adjustable image size
- Supports IC, FCC, and CULUS info
- CLI with short and long arguments

---

## 🛠️ Requirements

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install python3-pip python3-pil fonts-dejavu-core
sudo apt install python3-yaml python3-pil


## 🚀 Usage
```bash
python3 generate_elabel.py \
  -y elabel_config.yaml \
  -w 1024 \
  -h 768 \
  -o regulatory_info.png
